{"id":61169,"mal_id":61169,"title":"Black Torch","englishTitle":"Black Torch","title_english":"Black Torch","alternative_titles":{"synonyms":[],"en":"Black Torch","ja":"BLACK TORCH"},"synopsis":"Capable of communicating with animals, Jirou Azuma, a troublesome 17-year-old high school student, is constantly scolded by his grandfather for fighting humans that harm his winged and four-legged friends. However, after Jirou saves a black cat named Ragou from certain death, his carefree existence soon comes to an end.\n\nUnbeknownst to Jirou, Ragou is no ordinary cat but a mononoke, a magical creature of immense power. While trying to protect Ragou from another mononoke, Jirou is easily defeated and left for dead. In a dramatic turn of events, Ragou decides to pay off his debt to the dying young man, making Jirou a rare human-mononoke hybrid that easily overpowers his aggressor.\n\nUnfortunately, Jirou is now sought by both Ragou's kin who want to use the latter's powers, and the Bureau of Espionage, a secret governmental organization protecting civilians against hostile mononoke. Forcibly enlisted by the Bureau of Espionage's Ryousuke Shiba, Jirou must prove his worth in a new anti-mononoke task force, lest he be killed as a menace himself.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]","synopsis_es":null,"type":"TV","media_type":"tv","status":"finished_airing","averageEpisodeDurationSeconds":1425,"average_episode_duration":1425,"startDate":"2026-07-04","start_date":"2026-07-04","endDate":"2026-09-19","end_date":"2026-09-19","season":"summer","year":2026,"start_season":{"year":2026,"season":"summer"},"episodes":12,"num_episodes":12,"score":6.67,"mean":6.67,"numListUsers":118222,"num_list_users":118222,"genres":[{"id":1,"name":"Action"},{"id":27,"name":"Shounen"},{"id":37,"name":"Supernatural"}],"studios":[{"id":2696,"name":"100studio"}],"pictures":["https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1238/148379l.webp","https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1977/154148l.webp","https://cdn.myanimel